局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"tkc_9z3_91l"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p005452"]},{"id":"tkc_9z3_91l_B","label":"朱建子未名（使匈奴）（酈生陸賈列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"其子","mention_ids":["c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0111"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0111","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","quote":"其子"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p020","quote":"孝文帝時，淮南厲王殺辟陽侯，以諸呂故。文帝聞其客平原君為計策，使吏捕欲治。聞吏至門，平原君欲自殺。諸子及吏皆曰：「事未可知，何早自殺為？」平原君曰：「我死禍絕，不及而身矣。」遂自剄。孝文帝聞而惜之，曰：「吾無意殺之。」乃召其子，拜為中大夫。使匈奴，單于無禮，乃罵單于，遂死匈奴中。","source_term":"乃召其子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji097-004","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"tkc_9z3_91l"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p005480"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-097","chapter_id":"c-shiji-097-luli","mention_count":24,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-097-luli:m016-0000","c-shiji-097-luli:m016-0037","c-shiji-097-luli:m016-0041","c-shiji-097-luli:m016-0065","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0000","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0048","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0052","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0060","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0070","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0078","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0099","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0117","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0130","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0154","c-shiji-097-luli:m017-0158","c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0066","c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0070","c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0223","c-shiji-097-luli:m018-0227","c-shiji-097-luli:m019-0036","c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0024","c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0042","c-shiji-097-luli:m020-0069","c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0089"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-097-luli:p016","c-shiji-097-l